01:42:08.250 --> 01:42:10.250
<v Ingo>Gut, also deine Digital Crown.

01:42:11.370 --> 01:42:12.490
<v Felix>Ich glaube, das müssen wir zuerst machen.

01:42:12.650 --> 01:42:16.650
